WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.298 --> 00:00:15.700
snatched the ring from the contraption she'd built.

2
00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.042
"Don't worry," she said.

3
00:00:18.062 --> 00:00:20.363
"I'll deal with Morb."

4
00:00:21.244 --> 00:00:24.226
She stomped off, but Zann and the others caught up with her.

5
00:00:24.846 --> 00:00:26.507
"We're coming too," Zann said.

6
00:00:26.527 --> 00:00:29.289
"No." Wyssa shoved him aside.

7
00:00:29.309 --> 00:00:31.571
"It's my responsibility.

8
00:00:32.111 --> 00:00:33.492
Now get out of my way."

9
00:00:34.176 --> 00:00:35.578
"But we want to help!"

10
00:00:36.038 --> 00:00:36.659
Saffa said.

11
00:00:36.679 --> 00:00:39.081
"Yeah," Perda said.

12
00:00:39.101 --> 00:00:42.184
"Besides, you can't just leave us here.

13
00:00:42.685 --> 00:00:45.908
We might not be able to find our way back to Magica without you.

14
00:00:46.668 --> 00:00:48.851
Morb took our guidelink, remember?"

15
00:00:49.491 --> 00:00:50.232
Darb nodded.

16
00:00:50.252 --> 00:00:55.537
"And even if we do find our way back, First City isn't safe for us right now."

17
00:00:55.557 --> 00:00:58.160
"That's fine," Wyssa said.

18
00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:00.701
"Atmo is pleasant and safe.

19
00:01:01.201 --> 00:01:05.782
You can relax here, and I'll return for you once I'm done with Morb."

20
00:01:07.103 --> 00:01:07.843
Saffa nodded.

21
00:01:07.863 --> 00:01:10.024
"Perhaps that's for the best."

22
00:01:11.164 --> 00:01:12.584
"No!" Zann cried.

23
00:01:12.604 --> 00:01:14.105
"You can't leave us here!"

24
00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:16.986
"Yeah, what if you need our help?"

25
00:01:17.386 --> 00:01:18.206
Perda exclaimed.

26
00:01:18.867 --> 00:01:20.987
Wyssa's eyebrows shot up in surprise.

27
00:01:21.007 --> 00:01:23.188
"What?" she cried.

28
00:01:24.176 --> 00:01:29.401
"I don't require help from anyone, especially a bunch of chattering children."

29
00:01:29.421 --> 00:01:31.522
"You might."

30
00:01:31.983 --> 00:01:33.124
Zann didn't back down.

31
00:01:33.144 --> 00:01:36.567
"We were the ones who stopped Morb before, remember?"

32
00:01:36.587 --> 00:01:38.108
"That's right!"

33
00:01:38.448 --> 00:01:39.169
Perda chimed in.

34
00:01:39.189 --> 00:01:41.491
"We couldn't have done it without your help.

35
00:01:41.951 --> 00:01:44.933
But you couldn't have done it without our help either."

36
00:01:44.953 --> 00:01:48.036
"The kids have a point," Saffa said.

37
00:01:48.056 --> 00:01:52.540
"They've done more to stop Morb's terrible plans than anyone."

38
00:01:53.628 --> 00:01:54.989
Wyssa glowered at them all.

39
00:01:55.830 --> 00:01:56.850
Finally she shrugged.

40
00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:58.912
"Fine," she snapped.

41
00:01:58.932 --> 00:02:02.014
"But I'm not babysitting any of you, all right?

42
00:02:02.534 --> 00:02:03.315
Now let's go.

43
00:02:03.835 --> 00:02:06.457
I need to gather more ingredients on our way back."

44
00:02:08.498 --> 00:02:12.061
She grabbed more twigs and plants on the way to the Atmo wormhole.

45
00:02:12.841 --> 00:02:13.922
But she didn't stop there.

46
00:02:14.802 --> 00:02:18.785
Once they were in the vortex, she led the way into world after world.

47
00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:24.373
Zann and his friends had visited a few of the worlds before, but there were several that they'd

48
00:02:24.553 --> 00:02:25.194
never seen.

49
00:02:25.974 --> 00:02:30.937
They stayed in each one just long enough for Wyssa to gather a few ingredients.

50
00:02:31.698 --> 00:02:37.422
Zann and his friends barely had time to rest and recover their magic energy before they were zooming

51
00:02:37.442 --> 00:02:38.562
through the vortex again.

52
00:02:40.564 --> 00:02:44.186
After landing in one world, Zann felt weak and out of breath.

53
00:02:45.707 --> 00:02:50.170
He breathed deeply, and right away he regretted it.

54
00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.552
"Ugh," Perda exclaimed.

55
00:02:52.908 --> 00:02:54.589
"We're back in Niffia!"

56
00:02:54.609 --> 00:02:56.590
"Oh my!"

57
00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:58.010
Saffa looked startled.

58
00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:03.813
"I've read about this place, but the stench is worse than I ever could have imagined!"

59
00:03:03.833 --> 00:03:06.554
"Definitely," Gliss agreed.

60
00:03:07.274 --> 00:03:08.755
"Hush," Wyssa scolded.

61
00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:10.475
"Here come our hosts.

62
00:03:11.016 --> 00:03:14.317
Don't embarrass me by insulting their lovely world."

63
00:03:15.678 --> 00:03:16.858
Zann rolled his eyes.

64
00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:21.000
Niffia might look lovely, but it sure didn't smell lovely!

65
00:03:22.044 --> 00:03:28.266
As usual, a greeting committee was hurrying toward them with big smiles on their faces, which lacked noses.

66
00:03:28.286 --> 00:03:30.847
"Greetings, dear friend!"

67
00:03:31.387 --> 00:03:33.647
one of the Niffians cried, beaming at Wyssa.

68
00:03:33.667 --> 00:03:37.108
"It's an honor as always to have you here!"

69
00:03:37.128 --> 00:03:39.329
"Thank you, my friends."

70
00:03:39.689 --> 00:03:40.469
Wyssa smiled.

71
00:03:40.489 --> 00:03:45.311
"With your permission I'm here to gather some ingredients for a spell."

72
00:03:45.331 --> 00:03:49.392
"Of course—everything we have is yours."

73
00:03:50.236 --> 00:03:53.618
A Niffian waved toward the fields and forests surrounding them.

74
00:03:53.638 --> 00:03:55.600
"Please help yourself."

75
00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:57.141
"Thank you."

76
00:03:57.541 --> 00:03:58.241
Wyssa bowed.

77
00:03:58.261 --> 00:04:05.266
"While I'm gathering what I need, perhaps you would be so kind as to look after my friends?"

78
00:04:06.086 --> 00:04:11.270
"It would be our honor," another Niffian assured her, bowing to the kids and Saffa.

79
00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:17.116
"Come with us for some rest and refreshment."

80
00:04:17.136 --> 00:04:21.657
Zann and the others did their best to ignore the smell as the Niffians took them back to

81
00:04:21.677 --> 00:04:23.638
their town and gave them food and drink.

82
00:04:23.658 --> 00:04:28.139
"This world would be perfect if it didn't stink!"

83
00:04:28.799 --> 00:04:31.340
Zann whispered to Darb when the Niffians weren't listening.

84
00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:35.441
"And Morb might be perfect if he wasn't evil," Darb replied.

85
00:04:35.461 --> 00:04:38.262
"I wonder what he's doing in the Far Frontier."

86
00:04:39.062 --> 00:04:39.842
Zann shrugged.

87
00:04:39.862 --> 00:04:41.703
"Look, here comes Wyssa."

88
00:04:42.763 --> 00:04:43.643
Wyssa hurried over.

89
00:04:44.263 --> 00:04:45.744
The Niffians rushed to greet her.

90
00:04:46.428 --> 00:04:49.130
"I trust you found what you needed, my friend?"

91
00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:50.431
one of them asked.

92
00:04:50.451 --> 00:04:52.332
"I did indeed."

93
00:04:53.133 --> 00:04:54.373
She smiled and bowed.

94
00:04:54.994 --> 00:04:57.796
Then she turned to survey Zann and the others.

95
00:04:57.816 --> 00:05:00.738
"You look comfortable," she said.

96
00:05:00.758 --> 00:05:06.582
"Perhaps you should stay here while I, er, take care of things back in Magica."

97
00:05:07.342 --> 00:05:13.206
"No!" Zann blurted out, horrified at the thought of being stuck in stinky Niffia for a long time.

98
00:05:13.226 --> 00:05:15.828
"You promised we could come with you."

99
00:05:16.612 --> 00:05:19.273
"I promised no such thing," Wyssa retorted.

100
00:05:20.494 --> 00:05:23.435
Meanwhile the Niffians looked even happier than usual.

101
00:05:23.455 --> 00:05:26.876
"It would be our honor if you stayed!"

102
00:05:27.277 --> 00:05:28.137
one of them exclaimed.

103
00:05:28.157 --> 00:05:30.718
"Yes," another added.

104
00:05:30.738 --> 00:05:35.060
"That would give you a chance to see even more of our beautiful world!"

105
00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:42.283
"We can't stay," Zann said, trying desperately to think of a way to convince Wyssa not to leave

106
00:05:42.323 --> 00:05:42.923
them behind.

107
00:05:42.943 --> 00:05:45.084
"Wyssa needs our help."

108
00:05:46.428 --> 00:05:52.433
"Yeah, we haven't even had a chance to tell you about everything else that's happening in Magica," Perda

109
00:05:52.473 --> 00:05:53.073
told Wyssa.

110
00:05:53.093 --> 00:05:54.695
"Like what?"

111
00:05:55.115 --> 00:05:56.376
Wyssa sounded skeptical.

112
00:05:56.396 --> 00:06:02.741
"Like you shouldn't just go barging back into Magica without knowing that the king and queen quit and

113
00:06:02.801 --> 00:06:04.463
disappeared," Gliss said.

114
00:06:05.083 --> 00:06:06.424
Wyssa raised one eyebrow.

115
00:06:06.444 --> 00:06:10.307
"Interesting. But not relevant."

116
00:06:10.327 --> 00:06:16.132
"And how about Zann's parents being accused of stealing those missing relics?"

117
00:06:16.448 --> 00:06:17.068
Perda added.

118
00:06:17.088 --> 00:06:19.130
"Missing relics?"

119
00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.631
This time Wyssa's voice was sharper.

120
00:06:21.651 --> 00:06:23.232
"What missing relics?"

121
00:06:23.992 --> 00:06:24.733
Zann shrugged.

122
00:06:24.753 --> 00:06:29.575
"A few of the things in the lab disappeared, and nobody knows where they went or who took

123
00:06:29.635 --> 00:06:30.476
them," he said.

124
00:06:30.496 --> 00:06:36.159
"Like the Mask of Zanta, and—" "All right, that's enough chatter,” Wyssa interrupted.

125
00:06:36.179 --> 00:06:38.120
“I've changed my mind.

126
00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:39.721
You're coming with me."

127
00:06:40.541 --> 00:06:42.162
She bowed quickly to the Niffians.

128
00:06:42.182 --> 00:06:44.183
"Thanks again, my friends.

129
00:06:44.743 --> 00:06:45.804
We must depart."

130
00:06:48.041 --> 00:06:50.823
Moments later the whole group was back in the vortex.

131
00:06:51.504 --> 00:06:52.525
Zann was relieved.

132
00:06:53.206 --> 00:06:57.230
But why had Wyssa changed her mind so abruptly after hearing about the relics?

133
00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:01.454
Before he could ask, he saw a wormhole spinning toward them up ahead.

134
00:07:02.655 --> 00:07:05.458
"Hang on," Wyssa called, yanking them toward it.

135
00:07:06.179 --> 00:07:07.080
"We're here."
